  "$comment": [
    "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for which course packs are published to",
    "https://libre.academy/starter-courses/manifest.json.",
    "",
    "extract-starter-courses.mjs emits EXACTLY these packIds, in this",
    "order (the order the library renders them in). An id listed here",
    "whose .academy archive is missing from src-tauri/resources/",
    "bundled-packs/ FAILS the build \u2014 that is the guard that keeps a",
    "regenerated manifest from silently dropping live courses. An",
    "archive on disk that is NOT listed here is NOT published (the",
    "extract script warns so strays are visible).",
    "",
    "To publish a new course: commit its .academy to bundled-packs/",
    "AND append its pack id (filename minus extension) here. Anyone",
    "adding a course surgically on the VPS must add it here too, or",
    "the next full deploy will be refused by the manifest safety",
    "check in Web/libre.academy.",
    "",
    "manifestVersion is written into manifest.json verbatim. It must",
    "NEVER decrease \u2014 the deploy guard refuses a version regression.",
    "Bumped to 4 on 2026-06-10 to match the live manifest."
  ],
